This template's sample assets are original deterministic art generated by the
repository's own pipeline (see `src/dsh/client/pets/orb/PROVENANCE-orb.json`).
Replace them with your own original art and fill in the license, attribution,
and provenance fields in `pet/definition.ts`.

The repository-wide license decision is an Owner gate and has not been made
yet; see `docs/public/ASSET_AND_BRAND_POLICY.md` for the current metadata
contract. Your pet's data files carry their own license metadata and stay
your property.
